IT standard naming conventions in java
---------------------------------------

1. packages -> camelCaseConvention

   packageNameConvention
   

2. class/interface/enums   -> PascalCase
   
     ClassNameConvention
   

3. variables -> camelCaseConvention

    variableNameConvention

4. constants -> all caps
      
       ALL_CONSTANTS_CAPS

5. methods -> camelCaseConvention
    methodNameConvention()
    
    
